    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{32}{3} \\sqrt{6}$ sq. unit",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{16}{3}$ sq. unit",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{24}{5}$ sq. unit",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{gathered}\ny^2=-8(x-2) \\\\\ny^2=24(x+2) \\cdots(2)\n\\end{gathered}\n$$\nSolving (1) and $(2) \\Rightarrow x=-1$\nArea $=2\\left[\\int_{-2}^{-1} 2 \\sqrt{6} \\sqrt{x+2} \\mathrm{dx}+\\int_{-1}^2 2 \\sqrt{2} \\sqrt{2-x} \\mathrm{dx}\\right]=\\frac{32}{3} \\sqrt{6}$ sq. unit\n<img src=\"assets\\st0002_ec4d76ca0abb.png\">"
